h - 0.15)\n  :timeout -> max(0.0, old_strength - 0.05)\nend"},{"id":"blk-45560","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51299","text":"Tests"}]},{"id":"blk-45561","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51300","text":"Successful outcome strengthens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-45562","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51301","text":"Failed outcome weakens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-45564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51302","text":"causal_strength persists in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-45566","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51303","text":"confounders field accepted and stored"}]}],"id":"blk-45568","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51304","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45571","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51305","text":"GraphMemBench Phase 3: Full Suite + Competitor Stubs (3 days)"}]},{"id":"blk-45572","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51306","text":"Add remaining 40 scenarios (Categories 11-15, 8 each)"}]},{"id":"blk-45573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51307","marks":["bold"],"text":"Category 11: Causal Metadata (8 scenarios)"}]},{"id":"blk-45574","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51308","text":"causal_strength updates on outcome success"}]}],"id":"blk-45575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51309","text":"causal_strength decreases on failure"}]}],"id":"blk-45577","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51310","text":"confounders stored in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-45579","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51311","text":"Causal subgraph extraction (al